-MemCellType: SLCNAND
-CellArea (F^2): 4
-CellAspectRatio: 1
-GateCouplingRatio: 0.7
-FlashEraseTime (ms): 1.5 # taken from MICRON (https://www.micron.com/products/nand-flash/slc-nand/part-catalog/mt29f128g08akcabh2-10)
-FlashProgramTime (us): 350 # taken from MICRON (https://www.micron.com/products/nand-flash/slc-nand/part-catalog/mt29f128g08akcabh2-10)
-FlashEraseVoltage (V): 3.6 # taken from MICRON (https://www.micron.com/products/nand-flash/slc-nand/part-catalog/mt29f128g08akcabh2-10)
-FlashProgramVoltage (V): 3.6 # taken from MICRON (https://www.micron.com/products/nand-flash/slc-nand/part-catalog/mt29f128g08akcabh2-10)
-FlashPassVoltage (V): 3.6 # taken from MICRON (https://www.micron.com/products/nand-flash/slc-nand/part-catalog/mt29f128g08akcabh2-10)
-ReadMode: voltage  
-ReadVoltage (V): 0.5
